  m_Name: Earning Points - PopupTutorialData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: Earning Points
  descriptionEnglish: "Dealing damage and killing enemies generates blood points,
    used to open doors, buy weapons, and upgrades. \nKnife kills give more points
    but are riskier.\n\nPress {MELEE_BUTTON} to perform a melee attack."
  nameChinese: "\u83B7\u53D6\u79EF\u5206"
  descriptionChinese: "\u9020\u6210\u4F24\u5BB3\u5E76\u51FB\u6740\u654C\u4EBA\u4F1A\u83B7\u5F97\u9C9C\u8840\u70B9\u6570\uFF0C\u53EF\u7528\u4E8E\u5F00\u95E8\u3001\u8D2D\u4E70\u6B66\u5668\u548C\u5347\u7EA7\u3002\u7528\u5200\u51FB\u6740\u53EF\u83B7\u5F97\u66F4\u591A\u70B9\u6570\uFF0C\u4F46\u98CE\u9669\u66F4\u9AD8\u3002\n\u6309
    {MELEE_BUTTON} \u8FDB\u884C\u8FD1\u6218\u653B\u51FB\u3002"
  namePortuguese: Conseguindo Pontos
  descriptionPortuguese: "Causar dano e matar inimigos gera Pontos de Sangue, usados
    para abrir portas, comprar armas e melhorias. \nAbates com faca rendem mais pontos,
    por\xE9m com maior risco.\n\nPressione {MELEE_BUTTON} para realizar um golpe
    corpo a corpo."
  nameSpanish: Consiguiendo Puntos
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "Causar da\xF1o y eliminar enemigos genera puntos de
    sangre, usados para abrir puertas, comprar armas y mejoras. Las muertes con cuchillo
    otorgan m\xE1s puntos pero son m\xE1s arriesgadas.\nPulsa {MELEE_BUTTON} para
    realizar un ataque cuerpo a cuerpo "
  exampleImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1b1b945716ceb4a418edb93ce3b38651, type: 3}
